        <content type="html">
            <![CDATA[
                <p>Hi, I'm Hayden, I am a 15-year-old crochet artist. I love to crochet as a hobby and once I found out I could make my hobby into a business I was so exicted! I have been doing markets sence summer of last year (2025), and it has been SO fun to do what I love, and make it a busniess as well, and I hope you enjoy my creations as much as I do. </p>
